  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sohar to Ibri Water Supply Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project  is to provide sustainable supply of potable water to the main towns and villages within the Ad Dhahirah region from the new 250 Ml/day desalination plant, and thereby, ensure safe health and environmental conditions in the targeted areas, where the population is expected to reach 502,000 by the year 2035.</narrative>
  </description>
